BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//EOLkits//AWS Deprecations//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:AWS Deprecation Deadlines (EOLkits)
X-WR-TIMEZONE:UTC
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-node.js-20-phase-1@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Node.js 20 create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Node.js 20 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2023) deprecated 2026-04-30. Per the AWS Lambda runtime deprecation table\, AWS blocks creating new nodejs20.x functions on 2027-02-01 and updating existing ones on 2027-03-03 — part of the synchronized Q1-2027 runtime-block cluster. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-node.js-22-phase-1@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270602
SUMMARY:Lambda Node.js 22 projected create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Node.js 22 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2023) has a projected deprecation date of 2027-04-30. AWS currently projects blocking new nodejs22.x functions on 2027-06-01 and updates on 2027-07-01; AWS marks runtime dates as subject to change. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amazon-linux-2-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
SUMMARY:Amazon Linux 2 EOL
DESCRIPTION:Amazon Linux 2 reached end of life on 2026-06-30 and should be migrated to Amazon Linux 2023. AWS has published post-EOL AL2 releases\, so EOLkits does not equate the date with proof that a specific instance has received no later update; verify the installed release and current AWS support terms. Source: https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/update-on-amazon-linux-2-end-of-life/
URL:https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/update-on-amazon-linux-2-end-of-life/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-python-3.9-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Python 3.9 create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Python 3.9 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2) was deprecated on 2025-12-15 (no further security patches). Per the AWS Lambda runtime deprecation table\, AWS blocks creating new python3.9 functions on 2027-02-01 and blocks updating existing ones on 2027-03-03. Functions keep running\, but become unpatched and unmodifiable after the block dates. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-python-3.10-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Python 3.10 projected create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:AWS currently projects Python 3.10 Lambda runtime deprecation on 2026-10-31\, blocking new python3.10 functions on 2027-02-01\, and blocking updates on 2027-03-03. AWS marks future runtime dates as subject to change. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-python-3.11-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270801
SUMMARY:Lambda Python 3.11 projected create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:AWS currently projects Python 3.11 Lambda runtime deprecation on 2027-06-30\, blocking new python3.11 functions on 2027-07-31\, and blocking updates on 2027-08-31. AWS marks future runtime dates as subject to change. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-node.js-16-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Node.js 16 create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Node.js 16 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2) deprecated 2024-06-12. Per the AWS Lambda runtime deprecation table\, AWS blocks creating new nodejs16.x functions on 2027-02-01 and updating existing ones on 2027-03-03 — the same synchronized Q1-2027 block cluster as nodejs18.x\, nodejs20.x\, and several Python runtimes. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-node.js-18-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Node.js 18 create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Node.js 18 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2) deprecated 2025-09-01. Per the AWS Lambda runtime deprecation table\, AWS blocks creating new nodejs18.x functions on 2027-02-01 and updating existing ones on 2027-03-03 — part of the synchronized Q1-2027 runtime-block cluster. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lambda-python-3.8-eol@eolkits
DTSTAMP:20260830T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Lambda Python 3.8 create/update restrictions
DESCRIPTION:Python 3.8 Lambda runtime (Amazon Linux 2) deprecated 2024-10-14. Per the AWS Lambda runtime deprecation table\, AWS blocks creating new python3.8 functions on 2027-02-01 and updating existing ones on 2027-03-03 — the same synchronized Q1-2027 block cluster as python3.9/3.10. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
URL:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-runtimes.html
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
